### LogiTrans Express — ms-auth (puerto 8001)
@base = http://localhost:8001
@token = 42646305376fa2c6cf852c13b0095aaa72392410e6135e316ed81d17b5f20ed6

### 1. Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jnjimenez@logitrans.com",
  "password": "password"
}

### 2. Validar token
GET {{base}}/auth/validate
Authorization: {{token}}

### 3. Logout
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Authorization: {{token}}

### 4. Listar usuarios
GET {{base}}/usuarios
Authorization: {{token}}

### 5. Crear usuario
POST {{base}}/usuarios
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Operador Uno",
  "email": "operador@logitrans.com",
  "password": "pass123",
  "rol": "operador"
}